FIELDS

Tournaments, Meets
- ParseT:get_all_fields should differentiate t_chapter from rest
- The chapter info should only be YEAR, DATE_START, DATE_END,
  STAGE, major, minor, MOVEMENT (if there, could be higher too)
- ParseT should look up all such header pairs for {tname}{tag}

BBO data
- What goes in chapter-level:
  DATE, STAGE, any counters, TEAM?_*, BOARDS
  MOVEMENT and YEAR could go either way
- Anything with TITLE_, EVENT_ is renamed, no collisions
  but repetitions are OK; in the end no more Tword?
  45865
- n of m with n > m occasionally OK, but not always

Could have a more compact BOARD format when all is accounted for

Checks
- Fields in chapter-level Tournaments
- Note anything that is NOT matched by the best header
  - Probably either add to header, or remove manually

When matching up
- Figure out where YEAR and MOVEMENT go
- If there are counters in BBO, must be some in headers too
- If there are major/minor, there must be counters too (1+, 2+)
- MEET_ORDINAL vs ORDINAL
- TEAM?_FORM can potentially go away if perfectly matched
  If nothing left (22039), so be it

When matched up
- Tname date ranges as tight as possible? (Deviations noted but OK)
- E.g. Semifinal could be split by match
- GROUP could also be split on if it's in all the BBONO's
  5318
- #theoretical boards consistent within chapter? (16, 10, ...)
- Multiple attempts at same segment of a match
  23000, 23004, 23005 (candidates for skip files)
- If International, should have only countries
- If Interclub, should have only clubs
- If only countries, should be International

Manual checks:
- ORIGIN

